1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:05,482
On the coldest night of winter, a star fell into the mountains.

2
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:12,450
But it was not a star.

3
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:16,121
It was a dragon, and its heart of fire was going out.

4
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,705
So a girl from the village gave it the only light she had.

5
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:30,680
From that night on, they shared one fate.

6
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:42,842
Whenever the dragon flies, her lantern burns.
